OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity aims to save money with
OL,4,Ajob cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has launched a voluntary
OL,7,Fseverance scheme as part of an attempt
OL,8,Fto reduce its staffing bill by millions
OL,9,Fof pounds, the BBC understands.
OL,11,FAnglia Ruskin University, which has
OL,12,Fcampuses in Chelmsford, Cambridge and
OL,13,FPeterborough, has a staffing bill of
OL,14,Fabout #150m and is aiming to reduce its
OL,15,Flabour costs by 10%.
OL,17,FDr John Hogan, president of the
OL,18,FUniversity and College Union (UCU)
OL,19,Fbranch at ARU, said he believed it was
OL,20,Fbecause of problems attracting foreign
OL,21,Fstudents after changes to immigration
OL,22,Frules.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
