OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity aims to save money with
OL,4,Ajob cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglia Ruskin said, like other English
OL,7,Funiversities, it was "facing a number
OL,8,Fof significant financial challenges"
OL,9,Fand must manage its expenditure
OL,10,Fcarefully to protect its long-term
OL,11,Ffuture.
